    <string name="str_the_application_secu_116">The application securely reads financial transactions entirely on-device. By utilizing rigorous regex matching strategies against your SMS inbox format, it extracts exact monetary values, timestamps, and interaction classifications (Sent, Received, Paybill, Withdrawals). The parsing strictly respects your privacy—information remains sandboxed on your device behind robust Biometric Lock safeguards without arbitrary third-party cloud data uploads.</string>
    <string name="str_mympesaanalyser_acts_117">Smart Finance acts as your personal financial assistant. It automatically categorizes and visualizes your financial SMS transactions, transforming raw text messages into rich, interactive graphs, deep search functionality, and simple financial summaries so you can track cash-flow trends clearly.</string>
